{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1785385717255197002,"compiled_state":{"alias":"colourable-mystical-atlasmoth","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"7628ad120b95e37a9d683f77fc4b0a58793a06df57d401385a354184da8d4057","event_uuid":"236a8940-369f-4f0b-8379-91859b8812f4","position":{"commit_sha":"f47a029b1632b067c127378b17682e0d10257510","position":"1785385704505669001-236a8940-369f-4f0b-8379-91859b8812f4"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"68f5309e75c66919620fd74fd37cc20dcbcf2979b35aff1252b6d5571753f1f5","event_uuid":"81064536-400b-47eb-b69e-dac2a09a4417","position":{"commit_sha":"6aa67488da3d8340c67ca220cb7aa32c57f5638f","position":"1785385717255197001-81064536-400b-47eb-b69e-dac2a09a4417"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1785385704505669001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"81064536-400b-47eb-b69e-dac2a09a4417","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"9ad7-d5a2-a664-4827"}],"description":"## Summary\n\n`rebar link-audit --repair` unconditionally aborts with \"a reconciler pass is in flight (refs/reconciler/lock held or unreadable) — refusing to repair\", even when no reconciler pass is running. The guard never reads the lock at all.\n\n## Root cause\n\n`link_audit._reconciler_in_flight` delegates to `fsck_repair._reconciler_in_flight` (`src/rebar/_commands/fsck_repair.py:227`), which probes via:\n\n```\nfrom rebar_reconciler import _advisory_lock as advisory\n```\n\n`rebar_reconciler` is NOT importable from an in-process CLI invocation. It lives at `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler`, and `src/rebar/_engine` is deliberately not a package (no `__init__.py`) — the directory is put on PYTHONPATH by `engine_env`, which the CLI applies only when it shells out for the `reconcile` arm (`src/rebar/_cli/__init__.py:148-160`). Every other arm runs without it.\n\nSo the import raises `ModuleNotFoundError`, the function takes its fail-CLOSED branch, and returns True regardless of the actual lock state. Verified directly:\n\n```\npython3 -c \"from rebar._commands.fsck_repair import _reconciler_in_flight; print(_reconciler_in_flight(\\\".\\\"))\"\nTrue\npython3 -c \"from rebar_reconciler import _advisory_lock\"\nModuleNotFoundError: No module named \"rebar_reconciler\"\n```\n\nThe fail-closed policy itself is CORRECT — an indeterminate lock must not permit a destructive repair. The defect is that the probe is structurally unable to reach a determinate answer from the context it is called in, so \"indeterminate\" is the only outcome it can ever produce.\n\n## Impact\n\n- `link-audit --repair` (shipped in 9ad7-d5a2-a664-4827) is unusable. The 18 legacy bad edges in this repo tracker cannot be repaired, so story affe-2b42-4ee4-4e12 cannot meet its success criteria.\n- `fsck --repair` shares the same probe and the same import, so it is very likely affected identically. That path predates this work — needs confirming, and if so this is a latent pre-existing bug that link-audit merely surfaced.\n\n## Expected\n\nThe probe resolves the advisory module the way the engine does — put the engine directory on `sys.path` (or reuse `engine_env`) before importing — so it can genuinely distinguish \"lock held\" from \"cannot tell\". Fail-closed is retained for a genuinely unreadable lock; it must stop being the ONLY reachable outcome.\n\n## Notes\n\nDiscovered while running the authorized live repair for 9ad7-d5a2-a664-4827. Nothing was written: the tracker HEAD was unchanged and no `pre-link-audit-repair` tag was created, which confirms the abort happens before any mutation.","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[],"keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"480e-d9eb-7858-4e6d","ticket_type":"bug","title":"link-audit --repair can never run: the reconciler in-flight probe fails closed on ImportError","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["236a8940-369f-4f0b-8379-91859b8812f4","81064536-400b-47eb-b69e-dac2a09a4417"]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1785385717255197002,"uuid":"0bedf400-bcc9-40b4-9bf9-f0c8a3a2143a"}